- Why context and omnichannel history are critical to avoiding repetitive, trust‑killing conversations.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/68049391/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/68049391/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
