- Anyone who has nodded through “Delta Parquet on OneLake” and wanted a plain‑English translation.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/68001880/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/68001880/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

