- Product and engineering leads shipping multimodal or agentic AI into real business workflows.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67929056/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67929056/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
