- Managers who want their teams to focus on impact, not just inbox zero and checklist volume.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67589747/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67589747/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- Anyone using Microsoft 365 who suspects they’re only scratching the surface of what Outlook, To Do, Planner, Teams and Copilot can do together.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67589747/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67589747/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

