- Sales and revenue leaders frustrated by slow, labor‑heavy reporting cycles.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67572668/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67572668/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
- Finance and operations managers who suspect reporting is eating more time (and money) than anyone admits.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67572668/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67572668/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
