- Leaders wondering whether GPT‑5 in Copilot is just a technical upgrade or a real productivity shift.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67509218/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67509218/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
