- How Azure Logic Apps differ from Power Automate and where they shine.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67441755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67441755/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
