- Solution designers exploring how Graph meeting lifecycle events can integrate meetings with line‑of‑business systems.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67362624/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67362624/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

