- How to combine bots, tabs, and extensions into one coherent custom Teams app architecture.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67352748/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67352748/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

