- Product owners and tech leads who need Copilot to answer domain‑specific questions, not just generic prompts.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67342674/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67342674/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}

