- Data engineers and scientists who want Spark‑scale transformations without leaving the {{link|https://www.m365.fm/microsoft-fabric-simply-explained/|Microsoft Fabric}} environment.{{link|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67314574/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266|https://www.spreaker.com/cms/episodes/67314574/edit/info?filter=NETWORK&network=18613266}}
